  "title": "OPAL Fuels Welcomes Congressman Greg Murphy, M.D. to Sapphire Renewable Natural Gas Facility",
  "summary": "ROSEBORO, N.C. --(BUSINESS WIRE)--May 8, 2026-- OPAL Fuels (Nasdaq: OPAL), a leading vertically integrated producer and distributor of renewable natural gas (RNG) welcomed Congressman Greg Murphy, M.D. (NC-03) to its Sapphire RNG facility at the Sampson County Landfill in Roseboro, North Carolina.",
